# Topic contract: docs/DEVICE_CONTRACT.md. Prefix "smartlock" must match SMARTLOCK_MQTT_TOPIC_PREFIX.

# Core: publishes commands to any device, reads every device's ACK/event/status.
user core
topic write smartlock/+/cmd
topic read smartlock/+/ack
topic read smartlock/+/event
topic read smartlock/+/status

# Devices (MQTT username == device ID): read only their own commands, write only their own reports.
# A device therefore cannot publish commands or impersonate another device's ACKs.
pattern read smartlock/%u/cmd
pattern write smartlock/%u/ack
pattern write smartlock/%u/event
pattern write smartlock/%u/status
